+```
+9MCCCCCC  BBBBBBBB
+M = Type
+    0 = Virtual Base
+    1 = Physical Base
+    2 = Virtual Pointer Base
+    3 = Physical Pointer Base
+C = Count
+    000000 = Continue Until End of Cheat
